m as  having  so-called aspergers were subsequently  killed by nazis  so i was actually surprised that elon  musk even used that term  to describe his own condition maybe  that's a topic for another day  i like what david lit did here it did  get cut off pretty quickly  but there's really no other way to  pierce the news max filter bubble uh  because otherwise you know you can talk  about newsmax on other channels  but going on newsmax and doing it there  i think it's fantastic i loved it for  for me  it's perfect for a monday morning monday  morning is like the perfect day  to do what david did and quite frankly  it was kind of funnier than a lot of  recent saturday night live skits i have  not been super impressed  with snl recently um nice job by david  litt  and hopefully we'll have more of these  upcoming
 

